        "title": "Virus-Host Interactions and Tropism",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Viral tropism — which cells and tissues a virus can infect — determines disease\nmanifestation, transmission route, and pandemic potential. Tropism is determined\nprimarily by receptor distribution and post-entry replication capacity."
    },
